{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "launchpad",
  "name": "Novation Launchpad",
  "notes": "Session layout: 8x8 pad grid sends notes 11-88 (note = 10*row + column, row 1 at the bottom), the right-hand scene buttons send notes 19-89, the top row sends CC 104-111. This matches the Novation Launchpad MK2 (RGB, 2015); the bundled layout PDFs label the board 'Launchpad Mini mk2', but the classic Mini MK2 uses a different (0-based) note layout - on a Mini MK3 / X the grid notes match in programmer mode, while top row and right column send CCs 91-98 / 19-89 there instead. All LEDs are RGB and pick their color from the velocity value (Launchpad color palette, e.g. 5 = red, 21 = green, 45 = blue). Sending on MIDI channel 2 makes an LED flash, channel 3 makes it pulse (channel affects output only).",
  "manufacturer": "Novation",
  "mode": "standard",
  "defaultMidiChannel": 1,
  "layout": {
    "width": 9,
    "height": 9
  },
